# A full backup's id is its payload digest alone, as production derived it
# before #5418, so a capture of an unchanged tree republishes an existing id.
# ListedInSink holds only while every capture has its own id.
MODULE: BackupRetention
ROW: ListedInSink
FILE: src/lattice.backup/LatticeBackupCaptureService.cs
DETECTORS: BackupRetentionConcurrencyTests.A_full_capture_of_an_unchanged_tree_during_a_pass_is_not_deleted_by_it, CapturingClusterStampTests.CaptureAsync_identical_content_publishes_a_distinct_backup_per_capture
SUMMARY: a full capture of an unchanged tree republishes the id a retention pass is deleting

--- FIND
                var backupId = BackupIdentity.Compute(null, collector.ContentHash, artifactId);
--- REPLACE
                var backupId = collector.ContentHash;
--- END
